easurements being a bit off the bat  suit was still pretty epic to experience  wearing for pattinson  number six  how tall is tall enough  pattinson measures up at six foot one  but for his chemistry read with zoe  kravitz it wasn't quite enough the team  needed to see pattinson grow a few  inches so the solution was to pair his  batman suit which didn't even fit that  well with a pair of high-heeled sneakers  anyone who's worn shoes with lifts  inside knows that they are not very easy  to walk in and when trying to convince a  bunch of producers that you should play  a superhero well it leaves an actor  feeling pretty uncomfortable with the  whole situation pattinson awkwardly  walked around not feeling very much like  the caped crusader he was trying to be  number 7 enter the visual effects  pajamas at least that's what ben affleck  called his not so traditional bat suit  he was rocking the full cg mocap suit  and while it might have been a bit more  comfortable it didn't make affleck feel  anything like the superhero he was  supposed to be it was the most  humiliating ridiculous thing in the  world for the actor but he knew that it  was a major benefit to the cg team the  suit just didn't match the vive he was  going for leaving him very uncomfortable  throughout filming it made for a very  gloomy batman  number eight  need some extra muscle there's padding  for that traditionally wonder woman has  had a pretty specific built physique and  gal gadot wasn't exactly what fans were  used to the actress worked hard to bulk  up and added quite a bit of muscle but  it didn't keep her from avoiding the  dreaded padded suit her wonder woman  outfit was stuffed with loads of heavy  and warm padding muscles chest hips  everything was amplified making for a  not so great feeling experience for the  actor  we ended up having i think over 14  different costumes  number nine  who knew his suit was to blame  christian bale and his batman suit  weren't friends for a few reasons 